          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઝરણું (jharṇũ) is built on ઝરવું, to ooze, to trickle, which CDIAL lists under jharati, a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 5346): water that trickles out of the rock."
            }
